Core/Crypto: files translated from Mbed TLS

The files in this directory whose first line is
"// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0" are translations into Jet of
Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls, release mbedtls-3.6.7,
mbedtls-3.6.7.tar.bz2 sha256
a7e8bcbec0e6f761b4af24f25677626b35f762f68eef79c08677a363212d11f6).

Copyright The Mbed TLS Contributors.

Mbed TLS is offered under Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later (LICENSE-mbedtls,
beside this file). Jet takes it under Apache-2.0, and the translated files
are licensed under Apache-2.0. Each one names, on its second line, the
Mbed TLS sources it was translated from. They were changed in translation:
the C was rewritten in Jet, and each file's opening comment describes how
it departs from the C. Mbed TLS 3.6.7 ships no NOTICE file; this one is
Jet's.

The other files in this directory are Jet's own and are under the
repository's license (LICENSE at the repository root).
